      "applicability": "Applies to JSON-LD nodes of type ItemList, CollectionPage in the audited document (top level, top-level arrays, @graph entries; full schema.org IRIs count as the short type). Microdata and RDFa are outside this method.",
      "expectation": "ItemList fails when itemListElement is missing or an entry lacks position or url; CollectionPage has no required properties. Missing recommended properties: needs_review (Google's Rich Results Test reports missing recommended properties as non-critical issues (eligible, but a human should decide whether the data exists)). All present passes. Nested property values (an author Person, a provider Organization) are not nodes of their own and are not assessed; a page without a node of the type is not applicable. A page whose structured-data collection fails is not run for every feature, never clean.",
